<section>
	<h2 id="footer">Footer</h2>
	<p>
		Last but not least there is our footer area. The footer area is divided into:
	</p>
	<h3 id="top-footer">Top Footer</h3>
	<p>
		Top footer is divided in two sections that are explained in the subsections below.
	</p>
	<h4>Footer Featured Text</h4>
	<p>
		You can disable this custom text area, by deleting the content of the text area <strong>Footer featured text</strong> in <kbd><kbd><samp>Appearance</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Customize</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Theme Options</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Footer</samp></kbd></kbd>. In this text area, you can add whatever you want (text, images, HTML code, shortcodes, ...).
	</p>
	<h4 id="footer-widgets">Footer Widgets</h4>
	<p>
		Here you can add widgets in the <kbd><kbd><samp>Appearance</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Widgets</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Footer</samp></kbd></kbd>. There are also few options for that area in <kbd><kbd><samp>Appearance</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Customize</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Theme Options</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Footer</samp></kbd></kbd>. You can change the layout of the widgets, how many widgets to display and change footer colors.
	</p>
	<h3 id="bottom-footer">Bottom Footer</h3>
	<p>
		The Bottom Footer area has 1 custom text field. Custom text for the <strong>Footer bottom text</strong> can be added in live customizer <kbd><kbd><samp>Appearance</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Customize</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Theme Options</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Footer</samp></kbd></kbd>.
	</p>
</section>
